# Defines what is not part of the package which is published to pub.dev. It replaces the ".gitignore" of this
# folder for publishing, so everything that file ignores has to be repeated here.
.dart_tool/
pubspec.lock
/build/
/coverage/

# The visual-regression-tests compare the rendered widget with baseline-images which are stored at codeunit-level
# (see "Other/Resources/VisualRegressionBaselines" of the codeunit) and are executed by the build-pipeline of the
# repository only. Both the tests and the baselines they need are therefore of no use inside the published package.
test/visual_regression/
